[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2586136023","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101477#issuecomment-2586136023","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101477","id":2586136023,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aJU3X","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-13T04:04:47Z","updated_at":"2025-01-13T04:04:47Z","body":"Based from description (didn't open MRP) and as I remember, this is intended for any `Control` nodes and changing their sizes. Because it needs to propagate through scene tree for at least one frame. Add await for one frame after changing wrap mode and then you'll get proper size.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2586136023/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2586199164","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101477#issuecomment-2586199164","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101477","id":2586199164,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aJkR8","user":{"login":"feiyuhuahuo","id":32631344,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjMxMzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32631344?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo","html_url":"https://github.com/feiyuhuahuo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-13T05:27:45Z","updated_at":"2025-01-13T05:27:45Z","body":"@arkology   I tried use `get_tree().process_frame.connect(adjust_size, CONNECT_ONE_SHOT)` to wait one frame. But a flicker can be observed. I test with the following code to avoid the flicker.\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tpass\n\n\nfunc adjust_size_after_wrap():\n\tprint('--------------')\n\tprint(label_desc.size)\n\tprint(margin_container.size)\n\tself.custom_minimum_size = margin_container.size\n\n\nfunc adjust_size():\n\tprint(label_desc.size)\n\tself.custom_minimum_size = margin_container.size\n\t\n\tif label_desc.size.x > 500:\n\t\tself.custom_minimum_size = Vector2(500, 0)\n\t\tlabel_desc.autowrap_mode = TextServer.AUTOWRAP_WORD_SMART\n\t\tawait get_tree().create_timer(0.003).timeout\n\t\tcall_deferred('adjust_size_after_wrap')\n\t\t#get_tree().process_frame.connect(ppp, CONNECT_ONE_SHOT)\n\n\nfunc show_at(item_name: String, desc: String, to_guide: bool=false):\n\tif not self.visible:\n\t\tlabel_name.set_text(item_name)\n\t\tlabel_desc.set_text(desc)\n\t\tself.show()\n\t\tcall_deferred('adjust_size')\n\t\t#get_tree().process_frame.connect(adjust_size, CONNECT_ONE_SHOT)\n```\nThis is a dynamic size scene according to the text add to it. I use `create_timer().timeout` and `call_deferred` . Through this, no flicker is observed. But I'm afraid this is not suitable for every PC beacuse of different device performance.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2586199164/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2586268557","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101477#issuecomment-2586268557","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101477","id":2586268557,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aJ1ON","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-13T06:32:31Z","updated_at":"2025-01-13T06:32:31Z","body":"RTL final size is calculated during `_draw` call, so you can connect callback to it to get final value:\n\n```gdscript\n\t...\n\trich_text_label.autowrap_mode = TextServer.AUTOWRAP_WORD_SMART\n\trich_text_label.draw.connect(_on_rich_text_done, CONNECT_DEFERRED | CONNECT_ONE_SHOT)\n\n\nfunc _on_rich_text_done() -> void:\n\tprint(\"size: \", rich_text_label.size)\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2586268557/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2586355571","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101477#issuecomment-2586355571","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101477","id":2586355571,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aKKdz","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-13T07:13:46Z","updated_at":"2025-01-13T07:13:46Z","body":"> RTL final size is calculated during `_draw` call, so you can connect callback to it to get final value:\n\nUnfortunately can not find this in docs. So, looks like it is docs issue?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2586355571/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2591689681","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101477#issuecomment-2591689681","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101477","id":2591689681,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aegvR","user":{"login":"feiyuhuahuo","id":32631344,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjMxMzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32631344?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo","html_url":"https://github.com/feiyuhuahuo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T05:35:15Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T05:36:17Z","body":"@bruvzg connect callback to `_draw` does not work.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca8bd645-be38-4f01-9c2a-0e8517806d5e)\n(190,37) is not the right size. (490,112)  is what I expected.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2591689681/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3148536222","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101477#issuecomment-3148536222","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101477","id":3148536222,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67qtme","user":{"login":"feiyuhuahuo","id":32631344,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjMxMzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32631344?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo","html_url":"https://github.com/feiyuhuahuo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiyuhuahuo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-03T16:31:26Z","updated_at":"2025-08-03T16:31:26Z","body":"This is a, emm, hard to say. Maybe future version is better. Close this issue now.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3148536222/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3169138610","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101477#issuecomment-3169138610","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101477","id":3169138610,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc685Tey","user":{"login":"SiLiKhon","id":13967024,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTY3MDI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13967024?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiLiKhon","html_url":"https://github.com/SiLiKhon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiLiKhon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiLiKhon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiLiKhon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiLiKhon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiLiKhon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiLiKhon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiLiKhon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiLiKhon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiLiKhon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T19:56:13Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T19:56:13Z","body":"Connecting to `draw` worked for me (I have a Label + smart wrap, rather than RichTextLabel). The only adjustment I had to make was to allow for several calls to `draw`. I'm guessing it takes several draw iterations for these labels to settle with their sizes.\n\nNot sure if removing`CONNECT_ONE_SHOT` can lead to infinite loops, so I keep it but reconnect again a limited number of times from the callback.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.